# One function of a long chain of values, a cell that never escapes at
# each step and a region every hundred: the shape on which a bit vector per
# value, copied along every edge, once grew with the function's square.
# Compiled at its size and at twice it, no count of the compiler's work
# grows faster than the program.
step_limit=120
. "$IDRIS_MLIR_ROOT/harness/testutils.sh"
scale_relation long-function
